    "name": "Movie Quest",
    "steam_appid": 1909220,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>GAMEPLAY:</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909220/extras/8d841847ab3c8248a3eb597565389b02.avif?t=1736990670\" /></div><br><strong>Lifetime Long Movie Ticket - Open 24/7 - Movies Change Frequently</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Now Showing: </strong></h2><strong><br>\ud83c\udf9e\ufe0f Charade<br>\ud83c\udf9e\ufe0f Guns Of Eden <br>\ud83c\udf9e\ufe0f Night Of The Living Dead<br>\ud83c\udf9e\ufe0f Little Shop Of Horrors<br>\ud83c\udf9e\ufe0f Three Stooges Remastered<br>\ud83c\udf9e\ufe0f Angel and the Badman - Starring John Wayne</strong><br>Throw popcorn, eat pizza, watch real movies, socialize, RPG elements like leveling, questing, items, idle experience, emotes. Play Flappy Happy, exchange quest tickets for prizes!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>This game is a parody on a movie theater for public movie critiquing and public commentary using the game to view the movies. Some of these movies didn't make it in the theater and/or deserve homage, some even forgotten, most of the younger generations don't know these movies even exist! So as an indie dev I'm giving them expression and meaning in a artistic way with game development and public commentary bringing them back to life! </i>This game plays older movies that are non-copyrighted and plays newer things from youtube/streams</h2> <i>*Movies may contain, violence, gore, adult language* please see movie ratings before entering a showing*<i> THIS GAME IS PROTECTED BY THE FAIR USE ACT 1976 for purposes such as commentary, criticism and expression.<br>The game is being sold for the theater simulation experience to support development.</i></i>",
    "about_the_game": "<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909220/extras/8d841847ab3c8248a3eb597565389b02.avif?t=1736990670\" /></div><br><strong>Lifetime Long Movie Ticket - Open 24/7 - Movies Change Frequently</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Now Showing: </strong></h2><strong><br>\ud83c\udf9e\ufe0f Charade<br>\ud83c\udf9e\ufe0f Guns Of Eden <br>\ud83c\udf9e\ufe0f Night Of The Living Dead<br>\ud83c\udf9e\ufe0f Little Shop Of Horrors<br>\ud83c\udf9e\ufe0f Three Stooges Remastered<br>\ud83c\udf9e\ufe0f Angel and the Badman - Starring John Wayne</strong><br>Throw popcorn, eat pizza, watch real movies, socialize, RPG elements like leveling, questing, items, idle experience, emotes. Play Flappy Happy, exchange quest tickets for prizes!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>This game is a parody on a movie theater for public movie critiquing and public commentary using the game to view the movies. Some of these movies didn't make it in the theater and/or deserve homage, some even forgotten, most of the younger generations don't know these movies even exist! So as an indie dev I'm giving them expression and meaning in a artistic way with game development and public commentary bringing them back to life! </i>This game plays older movies that are non-copyrighted and plays newer things from youtube/streams</h2> <i>*Movies may contain, violence, gore, adult language* please see movie ratings before entering a showing*<i> THIS GAME IS PROTECTED BY THE FAIR USE ACT 1976 for purposes such as commentary, criticism and expression.<br>The game is being sold for the theater simulation experience to support development.</i></i>",
    "short_description": "Remember the times at the movies? Maybe you've got friends all over the world or want to go on a virtual date? How will you get together to watch a movie? With Movie Quest you can! Settle down and watch a movie, quest, roleplay, challenge each other to get through a horror show!",
